                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">Patton State Hospital, Human Resources Department, is accepting applications for at least one (1) Permanent, Full-Time Registered Dietitian. The positions are under the supervision of the Assistant Director of Nutrition Services. </span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">Major tasks, duties, and responsibilities include but are not limited to; completing nutritional assessments for patients; providing nutrition counseling for individual patients and/or patient groups; developing patient nutrition care plans; completing diet menus; providing in-service educational sessions for staff; and performing other tasks as assigned. Registration with the Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics is required. &nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">The position(s) require(s) a Drug Screening be passed prior to being hired. </span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 10pt 0pt 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;">In order to gain list eligibility and be appointed to the Registered Dietitian classification, please follow the link below to the exam bulletin. Failure to take the exam will result in your application not moving forward in our process. Please follow the directions carefully:</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 10pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;"><a href="https://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Exams/ExamBulletin.aspx?ExamControlId=1296" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0563c1; font-family: Arial; text-decoration: underline;">Registered Dietitian Exam Posting</span></a></span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">Unless there is a specific request to be notified via USPS&nbsp;mail, our main contact will be via email. Email correspondence regarding this job posting will primarily come from&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="mailto:PattonHREmploymentUnit@dsh.ca.gov" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #0563c1; font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration: underline;">PattonHREmploymentUnit@dsh.ca.gov</span></span></a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">.&nbsp;It is the applicant’s responsibility to check their email inbox, including junk/spam emails for any correspondence regarding their application status. In addition, applicants are encouraged to keep their CalCareers profile updated with a current telephone number, mailing address, and email.<br /> </span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #242424; background-color: #ffff00; font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;">***Click on the link to complete the Department of State Hospitals Recruitment Survey:&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdsh.sjc1.qualtrics.com%2Fjfe%2Fform%2FSV_9TCuZ0vceU3DEOi&amp;data=05%7C02%7CANTONIO.SILVA%40dsh.ca.gov%7Cddf5e9cd775e404a679008dc113e0573%7C807536a6a6b14893a01370509c59ebbb%7C0%7C0%7C638404205294137971%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=dEL4O6vLhIYy%2B2rGz%2B7M9RvTxshG1I6KcskEdmIH0mM%3D&amp;reserved=0" title="Original URL: https://dsh.sjc1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_9TCuZ0vceU3DEOi. Click or tap if you trust this link." style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #0563c1; background-color: #ffff00; font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">DSH Recruitment Survey</span></span></a></span></p><p>You will find additional information about the job in the <strong><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=26347900&name=DSH-3002-RegisteredDietitianDutyStatement.pdf' target='_blank'>Duty Statement</a></strong>.</p>
